On 2026-10-20, red-to-green Quizzes regressions caught a real unauthenticated
preflight stop before the first publication snapshot: the canonical command
returned `session-required` without operation counts, but the UI rejected the
response as malformed and displayed a generic pause. The UI now admits this
bounded no-count terminal state, makes no additional write, and presents the
